  229:         evolved_blend_weight : float
  230:             Weight of evolved signal in blend (0-1), remainder is hand-crafted
  231:         multi_horizon_blend : bool
  232:             P10: If True, blend signals from multiple return horizons (T+1, T+3, T+5)
  233:         blend_horizons : list of int, optional
  234:             P10: Horizons to blend (default [1, 3, 5]). Each horizon uses separate
